### Enhancement 3: Enemy Health System with Visual Feedback

```javascript
class EnemyHealth {
  constructor(type) {
    this.maxHealth = healthTable[type]; // Small: 1, Medium: 2, Large: 3
    this.currentHealth = this.maxHealth;
    this.healthBar = new HealthBarVisual(this);
  }

  takeDamage(amount) {
    this.currentHealth -= amount;

    if (this.currentHealth <= 0) {
      return true; // Destroyed
    }

    // Flash effect for hit feedback
    this.material.emissiveIntensity = 2.0;
    setTimeout(() => this.material.emissiveIntensity = 1.0, 100);
    return false;
  }
}
```

### Enhancement 4: Multi-Stage Explosion Particles

