### Enhancement 14: Glassmorphism UI Overlay System

```javascript
// CSS-based glassmorphism UI with neon accents
class GlassmorphismUI {
  constructor() {
    this.createHUD();

    // Apply glassmorphic styling to all UI elements
    document.querySelectorAll('.ui-element').forEach(element => {
      element.style.backdropFilter = 'blur(10px)';
      element.style.background = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)';
      element.style.border = '1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)';

